Problem Statement & What to Create
Write a program that takes a positive integer N from the user and prints all natural numbers from 1 up to N separated by a space using a for loop.

#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    int N;
    cin >> N;

    for (int i = 1; i <= N; i++) {
        cout << i << " ";
    }

    return 0;
}
